91	 * regex or a syntax error throws), then handed to JSONata's own `$eval` implementation. That runs
92	 * in the caller's environment, so lexical variables and functions stay visible and the nested
93	 * evaluation shares the caller's depth and deadline budget (the hooks live in that environment).
94	 */
